# 3-arg [case [let bindings] pattern body] — pin semantics.
# `expected` is NOT in the let-bindings set, so it is pinned (compared for equality).
# The arm fires when the scrutinee equals the current value of `expected`.
[expected: 42]
[match 42
  [case [let] expected "hit"]
  [case [let] _ "miss"]]
=== out
String("hit")
